  "title": "Orange Marmalade Cake",
  "description": "A spicy, fragrant Bundt cake with a hint of orange. This orange marmalade cake is delicious served with a hot cup of tea. When other types of jam are added in place of the marmalade, it&#39;s then called a jam cake.",
  "authors": [
